OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FWinds will
OL,6,Fease and any lingering rain at first
OL,7,Fwill soon clear away from Shetland
OL,8,Fthis evening, otherwise a few clearer
OL,9,Fspells but still a risk of showers
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,CFriday:FA mostly dry but cloudy start,
OL,13,Fa few showers may develop and more
OL,14,Foutbreaks of rain moving north over
OL,15,FOrkney in the afternoon, reaching
OL,16,FShetland later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
