OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:
OL,6,FUnsettled over the weekend, short-
OL,7,Flived brightness on Saturday morning
OL,8,Fbefore a stormy spell with heavy rain
OL,9,Fat times and gales expected. Brighter
OL,10,Fday Monday with lighter winds,
OL,11,Funsettled again later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
